&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India is one of Duolingo&#39;s most important growth markets. We&#39;ve operated there for a while, but believe it has much more potential than we&#39;ve realized so far. We&#39;re looking for a seasoned leader to own Duolingo&#39;s trajectory in India and build our business in the market. In addition to being a strategic, resourceful, high-influence generalist, we want someone with excellent product sense, built through leading or partnering closely with product teams at global consumer tech companies. You&#39;ll set the strategy, build and rally our team on the ground, and serve as India&#39;s bridge to our global teams and leaders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will be measured on Duolingo&#39;s core metrics: user growth and monetization. Like most leaders at Duolingo, you&#39;ll work in a matrix. Team members report into their functions, and you&#39;ll lead them as one cross-functional team focused on India. Instead of managing a market P&amp;amp;L, you&#39;ll spend your time on things that move these core metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Bangalore office and reports to the Asia Business Lead. We welcome candidates already in India as well as those willing to relocate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for India&#39;s strategy and priorities, and accountable for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead an India-based cross-functional team, as well as the culture and operating cadence that hold it together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of India: bridge what&#39;s actually true in market and what our global leadership and teams understand about it, and translate company priorities into work that makes sense locally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product teams to shape India-specific product and course improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence and align global, cross-functional teams to support the needs of India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in product, growth, or market leadership roles at global, high-growth technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record across both the US and India, credible with leadership abroad and effective on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent product sense, particularly for how global products get adapted for markets like India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to influence without authority, and an understanding of how different stakeholders think&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working effectively with colleagues across different time zones and locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias toward acting on what you see rather than waiting for someone else to prioritize it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and strategic, but also scrappy and willing to roll up your sleeves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for language education, for building Duolingo&#39;s business in India, and appetite for a multi-year bet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ Exceptional candidates will have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built a country team from near zero, including its culture and its credibility inside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapted an international product for users in developing markets, especially India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more Indian languages beyond English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
