ssion, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Warning: &lt;/strong&gt;Unfortunately, there is a rise in scammers pretending to be real Duolingo employees. Duolingo and our employees will never ask for your Social Security number, bank details, or passport info, and we’ll never ask you to deposit a check, purchase equipment, or exchange money during the interview process. Real Duolingo employees always use an email that ends in @duolingo.com or @recruiting.duolingo.com. Stay alert and double-check these details before sharing any information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;By applying for this position your data will be processed as per the&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTX9GKeRMOMA9Vtm0vfGibrYPYz8ysl0Dg8KSXgj_PxeT5ChsdnNZZWtpxu4t7xillTPGnngnKCjIbV/pub&quot;&gt; Duolingo Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our mission at Duolingo is to develop the best education in the world and make it universally available. It’s a big mission, and that’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Duolingo, you’ll join a team that cares about educating our users, experimenting with big ideas, making fact-based decisions, and finding innovative solutions to complex problems. You’ll have limitless learning opportunities and daily collaborations with world-class minds — while doing work that’s both meaningful and fun.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our life-changing mission to develop education for our half a billion (and growing!) learners around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Z7ph2&quot;&gt;Read &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.duolingo.com/?utm_source=greenhouse.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;amp;utm_campaign=generalblog_gh_091224&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duolingo’s brand is one of the most beloved and talked-about in consumer tech — and we’re looking for a senior leader to turn that cultural relevance into a measurable growth engine. As Head of Community &amp;amp; Influencers, you’ll build and own the function responsible for UGC reach, word-of-mouth acquisition, and creator-driven growth across all Duolingo verticals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role with broad strategic scope. You’ll define the vision for how Duolingo engages influencers, creator partners, and our global learner community — from celebrity partnerships to superfan advocacy programs to community experiences in and out of app. You’ll work at the intersection of brand, product, and growth, partnering directly with senior leaders across marketing, product, and data science to architect systems that compound organic distribution over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Head of Brand Marketing and will build, lead, and develop a high-performing team across influencer, creator, and community functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full influencer, creator, and community flywheel from strategy to execution and scale it into a measurable, top-of-funnel growth engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate our partnerships across celebrities, influencers, and creators from deal flow and negotiation to creative and results, optimizing for CPM and cost-per-new-user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect a world-class advocate network that converts brand love into measurable word-of-mouth growth, and keeps Duolingo culturally relevant at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and launch a tiered loyalty and rewards program that turns our most engaged learners into an owned growth channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate deeply with product teams to increase in-app shareability, surface community-driven content, and create in-app features that reward and incentivize organic advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the attribution and measurement infrastructure that connects community and creator activity to business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure new feature launches, vertical expansions, and cultural moments are systematically amplified through creator and community channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and build a high-performing team that executes at startup speed across the org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving measurable business outcomes across the creator &amp;amp; community industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built or led a product at scale in the creator economy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success building multi-platform advocacy programs with measurable ROI and business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing a scaled influencer program that contributed significantly to top of funnel growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of attribution, social, and product analytics with a proven track record of building scalable success frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐&amp;nbsp; Exceptional candidates will have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founder experience working in a 0 to 1 environment in the tech space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at a world-class consumer brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for education, culture, and language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
