&lt;li&gt;A graduate degree in Data Science, Statistics, Economics, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent demonstrated expertise in formal analysis methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of SQL, Python or R, AI tools, and data/analytics engineering ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
