&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the manager and team lead of the Experiments Team, you will oversee the A/B testing system that powers Duolingo&#39;s product development lifecycle. Experiments play an essential role at Duolingo, with almost all product changes going through some form of test. You will manage our in-house Experiment Platform that is responsible for defining experiments, executing them in the app, and measuring their outcome. While the role is platform-focused, you will remain highly connected to the product in all parts of Duolingo, shaping how we use A/B testing to build the best possible experience for our learners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand the capabilities on our Experiment Platform to support more sophisticated types of A/B tests and statistical methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower teams to confidently evaluate their key metrics and easily gate access to new functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of the accelerated feature shipping at Duolingo by enabling improved experiment automation and backend-based control of the learner experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the Experiment Platform to be able to handle dramatically increased experiment velocity in a statistically sound and cost-efficient manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product teams to devise unique approaches to measuring complex product scenarios and to advise on experiment strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of the Duolingo product lifecycle through A/B testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, managing, and building a team of software engineers, with demonstrated ability to hire, develop, and retain talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building scalable infrastructure and working with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing, either via supporting experiment infrastructure or using A/B tests in product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross‑functional leadership and communication skills, especially between product and platform teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work from or relocate to Pittsburgh, PA or New York, NY.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐&amp;nbsp; Exceptional candidates will have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building an experimentation platform or A/B testing-related tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a high-speed product development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with the statistical methods behind hypothesis testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
