&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge of iOS mobile application development for iPhone/iPad using Swift with Cocoa Touch and related frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing clean and maintainable APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multithreaded programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit tests and testable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of iOS SDK performance tools and optimization techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
