&lt;p&gt;We are building a world-class marketing organization at Duolingo with the goal to make a significant impact on the company&#39;s rapid global growth. For this growing team, we&#39;re looking for a curious marketing analytics manager to help us build the foundations of measuring and understanding the impact of our media spend. You will play a key role in enabling data-driven marketing campaigns for Duolingo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
