&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise using SQL to extract, clean, and transform data in large, complex, nested, databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with data visualization tools such as Tableau or Data Studio for data analysis, insight synthesis and presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong intellectual curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
