&lt;p&gt;Duolingo is the world&#39;s most popular learning app. Beyond our core learning product, we also offer English proficiency testing with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.englishtest.duolingo.com/&quot;&gt;Duolingo English Test&lt;/a&gt;, and are bringing new subjects into the Duolingo app, where people can develop their Math, Music, and Chess skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Product Manager for the Duolingo English Test, you&#39;ll drive product changes across the entire user experience: acquisition funnel, monetization, security, and test development. In addition to your product responsibilities, you&#39;ll partner with 90 cross-functional colleagues across engineering, AI research, design, marketing and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, you’ll make sure that students can gain access to educational opportunities by taking an English test from the comfort of their home. With over 6,000 partner institutions, we are disrupting the high-stakes language-assessment market. If you love making a difference in the world through technology, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;
