&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for improving the test experience and work closely with UI/UX designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with AI researchers to develop novel features to improve the test’s security and efficacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform qualitative and quantitative research to explore and validate feature ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers to help guide feature development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute with urgency and excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to make the world a better place through technology and education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience generating outstanding results as a product manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to utilize user insights, data, and statistical analyses to inform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top-tier design sense -- every pixel matters at Duolingo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to be resourceful, curious, and innovative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
