&lt;p&gt;The Platform Pillar ensures that Duolingo’s infrastructure, tools, and AI systems support our mission of delivering a seamless and personalized learning experience. This Pillar powers the technical backbone of our app and enables all other Pillars to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
