&lt;p&gt;The IAPs team owns Duolingo’s in-app purchase business: the gem economy, the shop, and avatar cosmetics and collectibles. You’ll build purchase flows and the systems behind them, then prove out what works through experimentation. Avatar cosmetics and collectibles are our new initiatives to drive DAU aligned monetization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Math Progress:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Math Progress team builds the experiences that connect Duolingo&#39;s math lessons into a cohesive learning journey. We help learners find the right content by improving how they navigate topics, grades, and the course path, and we make their learning progress visible through mastery signals, scored reviews, and personalized practice. The team works cross-functionally and experiments rapidly to help learners build momentum and continually strengthen their math skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-Form Learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
