&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking to hire a Staff Product Researcher to join our Product Research team to work directly with Designers and Product Managers to help us build a high-quality experience for our learners. You’ll help shape a product used by millions of users around the world by integrating research into &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.duolingo.com/?utm_source=blog.duolingo.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;amp;utm_campaign=handbook_blog_020725&quot;&gt;Duolingo’s unique product development process&lt;/a&gt; and generating insights that guide teams in choosing what to build and how to build it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, fast-paced role for a mixed-method researcher who can drive clarity in ambiguous spaces, influence product decisions, and deliver actionable insights at the pace of product development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set research direction with cross-functional partners by identifying the highest-impact questions and translating them into a clear, prioritized research projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end research across the product lifecycle; including 0→1 discovery on big bets, concept testing, and post-launch UX/UI iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong product intuition to generate insights and product ideas that connect the learner experience to product strategy, tradeoffs, and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build durable visibility for research: establish systems for sharing outputs and deliver regular, decision-focused updates that keep stakeholders aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate research impact through leadership beyond your own projects: mentor other researchers, uplevel our research practices, and introduce innovative methods/tooling when it increases speed and rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience leading product research for consumer-facing digital products, including owning complex problem spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mixed-method, collaborative research experience working with designers and product managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools throughout the research process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to generate clear and concise insights that deliver successful product outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience thriving in high-velocity environments while maintaining strong research rigor and craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐&amp;nbsp; Exceptional candidates will have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting international research or working with globally diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consumer tech or gaming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
