&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, high-visibility Staff TPM role at the center of one of Duolingo&#39;s most strategic engineering initiatives: dramatically reducing the effort required to get results and doubling developer productivity across the organization. You&#39;ll lead this initiative in close partnership with the Developer Amplification (DevAmp) Area, a team dedicated to accelerating how engineers work through better tooling, streamlined processes, and modern engineering practices. AI is one important lever — but the goal is the outcome: step-change improvements in how fast and effectively Duolingo engineers can build. This role is for a builder and a change agent: someone who can define what &quot;doubling productivity&quot; means in practice, align leadership and engineering teams around it, and drive the transformation to completion. If you thrive in ambiguity, have a bias for outcomes, and can bring people along through significant organizational change, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
