&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success balancing user growth and revenue expansion without degrading core user experience in a mission-driven product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating product strategy and results to executive and board-level audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed product leaders who&#39;ve gone on to run product orgs of their own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ads, subscriptions, and in-app purchase ecosystems, including experimentation at scale across these surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
